    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present to the market this very impressive, modern (built in 2020), three-bedroom, semi-detached home, which is presented in showhouse condition and is being sold LOCK, STOCK AND BARREL. Bay Meadow is an attractive, highly sought after, exclusive living destination, located on the fringes of Dublin City.\n\nBenefitting from generously proportioned and light-filled living spaces this house has been kept to an extremely high standard in recent years. Accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, living room, open-plan kitchen/dining room with a complementing utility room (plumbed for washer/dryer) and guest w.c all on the ground floor level. On the first floor you have three large double bedrooms (one en-suite) and main family bathroom. The layout and interior finish will make this property a popular choice for busy families looking for a turn-key solution in this most sought-after location.\n\nThe 23-METER-LONG rear garden is one of the largest in the estate and also benefits from a large side entrance. To the front you have parking for a number of cars, additional parking is on offer by means of several parking bays around the development. Another benefit with number 7 is it's location within this quiet cul-de-sac and opposite a large playing green which would be suitable young families.\n\nLocated within this highly regarded, much sought-after development. No. 7 Bay Meadows enjoys the best of both worlds, as it is away from the hustle and bustle, while still enjoying easy access to every conceivable amenity. Within close proximity of the N3/M3/M50/, Blanchardstown shopping centre, as well as a host of other amenities that include shops, schools, public transport, parks and sporting facilities.\n\nCall today to book a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.28m x 3.96m\nBright living room with laminate flooring and tv point.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.34m x 3.69m\nIncorporating a range of high-end appliances and work tops. Double doors leading to a 23m long rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 2.79m x 2.43m\nPlumed for washer/dryer, extra storage units and under stair storage room.\n\nGuest W.C. - \nWc, whb and extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.23m x 3.49m\nLarge double bedroom with ample wardrobe space.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.34m x 1.91m\nWc, whb, shower and window for natural ventilation.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.54m x 2.79m\nDouble room with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.43m x 2.50m\nDouble room with fitted wardrobes.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.48m x 2.05m\nWc, whb, bath with shower unit and window for natural ventilation.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> PROPERTY SOLD FULLY FURNISHED</li><li> High quality three-bed semi-detached home c. 111.6 sq. m / 1,201 sq. ft</li><li> Property built in 2020</li><li> 10 Year HomeBond Structural Guarantee</li><li> Three bathrooms to incl. family bathroom, en-suite and guest toilet</li><li> High standard of finish throughout and presented in an immaculate condition</li><li> Contemporary skirting & architraves</li><li> \"A\" Rated BER</li><li> Thermostatically controlled radiators in all rooms</li><li> A rated uPVC front door</li><li> Wired for alarm</li><li> Aesthetically pleasing external finish with a mixture of brick and render</li><li> Gas Heating</li><li> 23m / 75ft long back garden (one of largest in the development)</li><li> Opposite large playing green with childrens playground</li><li> One of the largest gardens in the development</li><li> Cobble lock driveway providing off-street parking for a two cars</li><li> Minutes drive from Blanchardstown and 10 minute walk from Tesco and Lidl</li><li> Quite cul-de-sac location</li><li> Easy access to N3/M3/M50</ul>"
      },
